摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Mission Control dashboard and human-review workflow for DeepSeek Harness sessions, turns, and tool activity.","id":"gh:1337780031","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"JARVIS-Mission-Control-DeepSeek","slug":"Asif2BD/JARVIS-Mission-Control-DeepSeek","topics":["agent-observability","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mission-control"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Mission Control dashboard and human-review workflow for DeepSeek Harness sessions, turns, and tool a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Control dashboard and human-review workflow for DeepSeek Harness sessions, turns, and tool activity."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# JARVIS Mission Control for DeepSeek-Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**The open-source AI agent orchestration board, connected to DeepSeek-Harness.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"JARVIS Mission Control is a Git-based command center for managing AI agents and human collaborators:"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" a live Kanban board, task manager, activity log, messaging layer, and review workflow — backed by p"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"lain JSON files and a Node.js server. This edition connects it to **DeepSeek-Harness (`dsh`)**, the "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"plugin-kernel agent harness from DeepSeek: every dsh session appears as a task on your board, every "},{"id":"p4s5","text":"turn and tool call streams into the activity log, and finished work lands in `REVIEW` for a human to"},{"id":"p4s6","text":"tool call streams into the activity log, and finished work lands in `REVIEW` for a human to approve."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Status: Experimental.** dsh is a v0.1 developer preview with announced breaking changes. The bri"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"dge is validated against `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.0-rc.7` type definitions and covered by committed tes"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ts; event names are config-overridable so upstream renames are a config fix."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## How It Connects"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"`dsh` treats everything as a plugin and broadcasts every model-visible moment on an append-only sess"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ion event stream. Our bridge mounts *inside* the harness as a Cordis plugin and forwards that stream"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" to Mission Control's REST API — no polling, no log scraping, no server changes:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| dsh event | Board effect |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| `session/created` | Task created (`IN_PROGRESS`, assigned to the harness agent) |\n| `user/message`"},{"id":"p10s2","text":", `assistant/message` | Activity log excerpts |\n| `tool/call`, `tool/result` | Activity log entries "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"(with error codes) |\n| `turn/end` → `completed` | Task → `REVIEW` — humans approve to `DONE` |\n| `tu"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"rn/end` → `blocked` / `failed` | Task → `BLOCKED`, structured error logged |\n| `turn/end` → `aborted"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"` / `interrupted` | Task → `ASSIGNED` |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Open the board at `http://localhost:3000` and start a dsh session — the task appears as soon as the "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"d at `http://localhost:3000` and start a dsh session — the task appears as soon as the session does."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Full setup, config reference, and troubleshooting:** `integrations/deepseek-harness/README.md`\n**A"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"rchitecture analysis and design rationale:** `docs/deepseek-harness-integration.md`"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What's in the Box"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Piece | Path | What it does |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| **Dashboard** | `dashboard/` | Kanban board, agent profiles, chat, activity feed, WebSocket live u"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"pdates |\n| **Server** | `server/` | Express + WebSocket API over `.mission-control/` JSON files |\n| "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"**dsh bridge** | `integrations/deepseek-harness/` | The Cordis plugin (`dsh-plugin-mission-control`)"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" with its test suite |\n| **Data** | `.mission-control/` | Tasks, agents, humans, messages — Git-vers"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ioned JSON, no database |\n| **Skills** | `skills/` | Modular agent instructions, including the dsh b"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"ridge skill |\n| **Scripts** | `scripts/` | Setup helpers (`add-agent.sh`, `add-human.sh`, `init-miss"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"ion-control.sh`, …) |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin ships with **auth support** (`MC_AGENT_TOKEN` / `authToken` → `Authorization: Bearer`), a"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" **serialized retry queue** so a dead board never blocks the agent loop, and an **awaited bounded `f"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"lush()`** wired to dsh's `session/flush` durability checkpoint."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## MissionDeck Platform"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This open-source repo is the engine. MissionDeck.ai is the platform around it — hosted dashboards (`"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"missiondeck.ai/mission-control/your-slug`), visual agent building, and one-click deployment. A free "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"API key from missiondeck.ai/auth connects your instance:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Heritage & Roadmap"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"This project began as a port of JARVIS Mission Control (v2.1.0); the board, server, and data model c"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"arry over, and everything runtime-specific here targets DeepSeek-Harness only. See the repo issues f"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"everything runtime-specific here targets DeepSeek-Harness only. See the repo issues for the roadmap:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. Live end-to-end validation with a real `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`\n2. dsh-native cost tracking (per-step `"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"usage` from `assistant/message` events → the dashboard cost cards)\n3. Track new dsh preview releases"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" with a compatibility canary and configurable event mappings"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT — free to use, fork, and build on."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
